omllc/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf","description":"5G User Plane Function (UPF) based on eBPF","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/deployments","created_at":"2022-12-01T18:01:16Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:53:45Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-03T13:53:40Z","git_url":"git://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:edgecomllc/eupf.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf","homepage":"","size":2691,"stargazers_count":187,"watchers_count":187,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":39,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":35,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["3gpp","5g","cilium","ebpf","upf"],"visibility":"public","forks":39,"open_issues":35,"watchers":187,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/pulls/650","html_url":"https://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf/pull/650","diff_url":"https://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf/pull/650.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/edgecomllc/eupf/pull/650.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-11T13:36:32Z"},"body":"Fixes #647.\n\n*(Branch rewritten per review: the ENOENT handling moved into `mapOperations` (cmd/ebpf), `ReadUrr` is extracted, and `HandlePfcpSessionModificationRequest` is covered by the same change.)*\n\n## What\n\n1. **`Handle()`** — always transmit the handler's response when non-nil. A send error is logged, and only propagated when the handler itself succeeded.\n2. **`mapOperations` (cmd/ebpf)** — delete operations absorb \"key absent\" (`ebpf.ErrKeyNotExist` / `ENOENT`) as success via `isKeyAbsent()`, so no caller needs to care about this error: the desired end state of a delete is that the entry is absent. This uniformly covers every delete call site, including `HandlePfcpSessionModificationRequest` (RemoveFAR / RemoveQER / RemoveURR).\n3. **`DeleteUrr()` split** — `ReadUrr()` now explicitly returns the URR usage data; `DeleteUrr()` has the conventional error-only signature (as suggested in review). The deletion/modification handlers read first, then delete.\n\n## Why\n\nMeasured on a session-churn workload:\n\n```\nupf_pfcp_rx{Session Deletion Request} = 21\nupf_pfcp_tx{Session Deletion Response} = 8\nupf_pfcp_rx_errors{cause=RuleCreationModificationFailure, ...} = 13\n```\n\n13 deletion requests received **no response at all**: the handler returned `(failure-response, err)` after `Can't delete GTP PDR: delete: key does not exist`, and `Handle()` returned before sending the response it had built. The CP side (open5gs SMF) then timed out its PFCP transaction — on some open5gs versions that even aborts the whole SMF process (related: open5gs/open5gs#4833).\n\n## Verification\n\nPatched build, same workload afterwards: `rx = 7 / tx = 7`, all requests answered with `RequestAccepted`, no `Error handling PFCP` warnings in the log. `go build ./...` and `go vet ./cmd/...` (tests included) are clean, and the touched files are gofmt-clean.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/issues/650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgecomllc/eupf/issues/650/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"zhangerfei-dp","id":334437229,"node_id":"U_kgDOE-8bbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334437229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangerfei-dp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangerfei-dp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T11:29:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T11:29:48Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4834","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issue